<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">newbie</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">newbie</ansi> command talks on the world-wide
<ansi fg="green">newbie</ansi> channel — the place to ask for help. Everyone is
listening by default, so there is usually someone around to answer.

If you are an experienced player and want to help (or want quiet), turn the
channel on or off with <ansi fg="command">channels</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">newbie how do I equip a weapon?</ansi>

  Output to everyone with newbie on:

  <ansi fg="green">(newbie)</ansi> Charles: how do I equip a weapon?
